		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Parasitic plant. Plants seeds in mortals, who are living hosts for the parasite. Must be carefully removed.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 19, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 tendril +0 (1 + paralyze), <strong>MV</strong> close (burrow, climb), <strong>S</strong> -4, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +1, <strong>I</strong> -3, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> +1, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 4</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Paralyze</strong>. CON 15+ or paralyzed for 1d4 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Parasite</strong>. Once seed is planted in willing or helpless mortal, host is dominated, takes 1d4 CHA damage per week, dying at 0 CHA. Attacks against griefgall split damage between parasite and host.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
